SUMMARY:Labor Day Lunch ~ Goodbye to Summer! 🌞 👋
DESCRIPTION:Senior Singles Fun Bunch\n**Dawn suggested (suggestions are al
 ways welcomed from anyone!) we go to Papa’s & Beer 🍺 in Hendersonvill
 e for some good Mexican food. Sounded good to me! And to celebrate closing
  out the summer why not on Labor Day weekend? So I made this meetup for a 
 Labor Day lunch.** **So come on out!**\n\n**LOCATION:** **This is the Papa
 ’s & Beer in Hendersonville (close to Bay Breeze Seafood Restaurant) ~ n
 ot the Asheville location.**\n\n****************NOTE:** **Papa’s & Beer 
 does not take reservations so please be patient if we have to wait about 1
 0 minutes or so to be seated.**\n\n**WEBSITE/MENU:** **Check out their lun
 ch menu at www.papasandbeerhendo.com. By the way\, they do offer vegan\, v
 egetarian\, and gluten-free options. They also have a full liquor bar and 
 also a salsa bar.** **😋**\n\n**PARKING:** **If you can’t get a parkin
 g place in the front there is parking in the rear of the restaurant.** **
 🚗**\n\n**PET FRIENDLY: Leashed\, well-behaved dogs are allowed on their
  enclosed outdoor area.** **🐶🐾**\n\n**Hope you will join me at Papa
 ’s & Beer! 🍺 Happy Labor Day! 🌞**\n\n**QUESTIONS/CONCERNS:**\n**Sh
 ae.kemerer@aol.com**\n**(828)699-8180 (Call or text)**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/seniorsinglesfunbunch/events/31592474
