SUMMARY:Carolina Sky Highlands ~ Shaggy Cow Farm Tour
DESCRIPTION:Senior Singles Fun Bunch\n**Carolina Sky Highlands is a farm i
 n Marion\, N.C. known for their shaggy highland cows.**\n**I have schedule
 d us a one-hour tour to see those big\, fluffy highland cattle! Also there
  are horses\, Texas longhorns\, and other farm animals. This will be a han
 ds-on guided tour where we will be feeding\, brushing (the highland cows l
 ove to be brushed!) and petting animals. 🐮 🐴 🐷 🐑**\n\n**COST: 
 $15.** **We will be getting a group discount (yay!) so instead of $20 our 
 cost will be $15 per person for the one-hour tour. You will pay at the far
 m. They accept cash\, Venmo\, PayPal\, or CashApp.**\n\n**WHAT TO WEAR:** 
 **Please dress very casual for we will probably be getting dirty. Definite
 ly wear closed-toe shoes (I’m wearing rubber rain boots) for there will 
 be “cow glitter” 💩 here\, there\, and everywhere! You might want to
  put some backup shoes in your car. 👞**\n\n**RESTROOMS/HANDWASHING STAT
 ION:** **Available to wash all that fur off your hands from petting & feed
 ing the animals.**\n\n**DOGS:** **Not allowed for the safety of the farm a
 nimals.** **🐶**\n\n**FACEBOOK/WEBSITE:** **Check out their facebook pag
 e and website for photos\, more information about the farm\, etc. Carolina
  Sky Highlands.**\n\n**GIFT SHOP: You just might want to buy a souvenir!**
 \n\n**DIRECTIONS: Your GPS may announce “arrived” before the bridge to
  the farm ~ ignore it! Go ahead and cross the bridge and you will see an o
 pen field. Just follow the parking signs.**\n\n**LATE LUNCH: Countryside B
 BQ. For those who want to grab a bite to eat afterwards. It’s a come-as-
 you-are restaurant which would be perfect for us after being out with the 
 farm animals! We might be a little smelly! 😜**\n**If you wish to go ple
 ase RSVP separately.**\n\n**I hope to see you at the farm! I can’t wait 
 to brush a shaggy highland cow!! 😄**\n\n**QUESTIONS/CONCERNS:**\n**Shae
 .kemerer@aol.com**\n**(828)699-8180 (Text or call)**\n**I work so I prefer
  text\, but I will return your call when I can.**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/seniorsinglesfunbunch/events/31564300
