SUMMARY:A Relaxing Wednesday at Burntshirt Vineyards ~ Vintner’s Table R
 estaurant 🍷🍷
DESCRIPTION:Senior Singles Fun Bunch\n**Come join Billy at Vintner’s Tab
 le Restaurant at Burntshirt Vineyards for another wine & food meetup. Vint
 ner’s Table is a farm-to-table restaurant with Mediterranean-inspired di
 shes\, wines\, & cocktails. It offers indoor and outdoor seating. So come 
 on out and join Billy for a glass of wine/good food and a relaxing Wednesd
 ay afternoon in a beautiful setting. And thank you\, Billy\, for hosting t
 hese wine & food meetups for us! 🤗🍷🥪**\n\n**MENU: www.burntshirtv
 ineyards.com. Billy highly recommends their Reuben sandwiches!🥪**\n\n**
 PET-FRIENDLY: 🐶 Well-behaved dogs on leashes are allowed on the outdoor
  patio & veranda\, and the tasting room. They are not allowed inside the r
 estaurant.**\n\n**PARKING:🅿️ Plenty of parking available.**\n\n**WHER
 E TO MEET: Please meet by the live music sign. 🎶**\n\n**RESERVATIONS: B
 illy will have tables reserved.**\n\n**Billy hopes to see you on Wednesday
 ! 🍷🍷**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/seniorsinglesfunbunch/events/31639159
